{"3782920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HARMONIC REFLECTIONS", "steam_appid": 3782920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harmonic Reflections is a story-driven visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy who can no longer hear the piano finds his heart wavering between two girls in this fleeting, coming-of-age summer love story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices decide which girl he ends up with, leading to two different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated game length is about 5 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a tender story with beautiful visuals and a richly varied soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782920/extras/ec0dd29b2e0dac16354f6f3406950c62.avif?t=1760951485\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >＜STORY＞</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The truth is, I have memories of the future.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >―says a mysterious girl who appears before the third-year high schooler Aruto Mozumi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having lost his childhood memories and the ability to hear the piano, Aruto can only watch as his younger brother Tokio shines with natural genius.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why does the sound of the piano escape him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weighed down by this vague unease, he cannot even bring himself to confess his feelings to the classmate he likes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is now his final summer of high school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aruto's fate begins to shift when he is guided by a girl who holds memories of the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The curtain rises on a fleeting, bittersweet love story of one unforgettable summer.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harmonic Reflections is a story-driven visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy who can no longer hear the piano finds his heart wavering between two girls in this fleeting, coming-of-age summer love story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices decide which girl he ends up with, leading to two different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated game length is about 5 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a tender story with beautiful visuals and a richly varied soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782920/extras/ec0dd29b2e0dac16354f6f3406950c62.avif?t=1760951485\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >＜STORY＞</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The truth is, I have memories of the future.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >―says a mysterious girl who appears before the third-year high schooler Aruto Mozumi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having lost his childhood memories and the ability to hear the piano, Aruto can only watch as his younger brother Tokio shines with natural genius.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why does the sound of the piano escape him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weighed down by this vague unease, he cannot even bring himself to confess his feelings to the classmate he likes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is now his final summer of high school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aruto's fate begins to shift when he is guided by a girl who holds memories of the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The curtain rises on a fleeting, bittersweet love story of one unforgettable summer.</p>", "short_description": "A boy who can no longer hear the piano, living in the shadow of his gifted younger brother; a karate girl who is more than a friend but not yet a lover; and a girl with future memories. As past and future entwine, where will this triangle lead in this fleeting, bittersweet summer love story?", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782920/77a729f46bfc5439cf843de6abae9b6ad4e5965a/header.jpg?t=1760951485", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782920/dd216ecc173346521648ac80b1783b6507430263/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760951485", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782920/dd216ecc173346521648ac80b1783b6507430263/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760951485", "website": "https://laplacian.jp/games/kenban/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft OS: Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core 3GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectSound</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 11</li></ul